    "name": "Tiny Monster Village",
    "steam_appid": 3450540,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this heartwarming village management game, you'll help bullied Little Monsters from other games rebuild their sanctuary! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience idyllic farm life alongside them: cultivate mystical crops, fish for mysterious creatures, run quirky shops, and explore mineral-rich caverns.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dice of Destiny System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dice determine every action! From planting to trading, our unique dice-check mechanic blends luck and strategy, making each decision a thrilling gamble that shapes your village's future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/99b6b19a09887d0215c8cb3a8f8672ee.poster.avif?t=1755087393\" width=642 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/99b6b19a09887d0215c8cb3a8f8672ee.webm?t=1755087393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/99b6b19a09887d0215c8cb3a8f8672ee.mp4?t=1755087393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Monster Sanctuary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give shelter to creatures exiled from other worlds! Each monster possesses unique skills and a distinct backstory. Assign tasks strategically to unlock their hidden potential and build the coziest monster utopia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/0da366acd29fd7b3ff0dfa80c3977ee7.poster.avif?t=1755087393\" width=642 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/0da366acd29fd7b3ff0dfa80c3977ee7.webm?t=1755087393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/0da366acd29fd7b3ff0dfa80c3977ee7.mp4?t=1755087393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Divine Playstyle Crafting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine sacred idol blessings with legendary artifacts to forge your personal management style! Whether pursuing agricultural abundance or mining fortunes, your strategy defines the village's destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/dc128d6fb2d243e5145145829cc49857.poster.avif?t=1755087393\" width=642 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/dc128d6fb2d243e5145145829cc49857.webm?t=1755087393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/dc128d6fb2d243e5145145829cc49857.mp4?t=1755087393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multidimensional Biomes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pioneer fantastical ecosystems! Grow enchanted flora in glowing forests, mine rare crystals in geodesic caverns - each terrain holds unique resources and secrets waiting beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/bc5e55e7c7ef9b890d25dd3451c10934.poster.avif?t=1755087393\" width=642 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/bc5e55e7c7ef9b890d25dd3451c10934.webm?t=1755087393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/bc5e55e7c7ef9b890d25dd3451c10934.mp4?t=1755087393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Desktop Transcendence</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the fourth wall of gaming! Minimize to a live desktop widget observing your village, or plant computer files as seeds - who knows what digital wonders might sprout?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/a02104eaae2748dce6c5993a68540028.poster.avif?t=1755087393\" width=932 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/a02104eaae2748dce6c5993a68540028.webm?t=1755087393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/a02104eaae2748dce6c5993a68540028.mp4?t=1755087393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this heartwarming village management game, you'll help bullied Little Monsters from other games rebuild their sanctuary! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience idyllic farm life alongside them: cultivate mystical crops, fish for mysterious creatures, run quirky shops, and explore mineral-rich caverns.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dice of Destiny System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dice determine every action! From planting to trading, our unique dice-check mechanic blends luck and strategy, making each decision a thrilling gamble that shapes your village's future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/99b6b19a09887d0215c8cb3a8f8672ee.poster.avif?t=1755087393\" width=642 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/99b6b19a09887d0215c8cb3a8f8672ee.webm?t=1755087393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/99b6b19a09887d0215c8cb3a8f8672ee.mp4?t=1755087393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Monster Sanctuary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give shelter to creatures exiled from other worlds! Each monster possesses unique skills and a distinct backstory. Assign tasks strategically to unlock their hidden potential and build the coziest monster utopia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/0da366acd29fd7b3ff0dfa80c3977ee7.poster.avif?t=1755087393\" width=642 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/0da366acd29fd7b3ff0dfa80c3977ee7.webm?t=1755087393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/0da366acd29fd7b3ff0dfa80c3977ee7.mp4?t=1755087393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Divine Playstyle Crafting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine sacred idol blessings with legendary artifacts to forge your personal management style! Whether pursuing agricultural abundance or mining fortunes, your strategy defines the village's destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/dc128d6fb2d243e5145145829cc49857.poster.avif?t=1755087393\" width=642 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/dc128d6fb2d243e5145145829cc49857.webm?t=1755087393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/dc128d6fb2d243e5145145829cc49857.mp4?t=1755087393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multidimensional Biomes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pioneer fantastical ecosystems! Grow enchanted flora in glowing forests, mine rare crystals in geodesic caverns - each terrain holds unique resources and secrets waiting beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/bc5e55e7c7ef9b890d25dd3451c10934.poster.avif?t=1755087393\" width=642 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/bc5e55e7c7ef9b890d25dd3451c10934.webm?t=1755087393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/bc5e55e7c7ef9b890d25dd3451c10934.mp4?t=1755087393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Desktop Transcendence</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the fourth wall of gaming! Minimize to a live desktop widget observing your village, or plant computer files as seeds - who knows what digital wonders might sprout?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/a02104eaae2748dce6c5993a68540028.poster.avif?t=1755087393\" width=932 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/a02104eaae2748dce6c5993a68540028.webm?t=1755087393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/a02104eaae2748dce6c5993a68540028.mp4?t=1755087393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to a unique non-combat monster village management game! Here, you'll manage quirky villagers to farm, build, trade, fish, and uncover their stories. Through strategic planning, watch your village flourish as you unlock secrets and special events.",
